This directory contains Fortran test codes from the gfortran test suite.

Every positive test must pass the pinned Flang frontend's mandatory syntax and
semantic validation. In the legacy test lists (now mirrored in CMake) are the
lists of files assigned to the variables:
   F90_TESTCODES_REQUIRED_TO_PASS
and
   F77_FIXED_FORMAT_TESTCODES_REQUIRED_TO_PASS
and defined to be a short and long list depending on the legacy
ROSE_USE_LONG_MAKE_CHECK_RULE conditional.
